{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_18", "source_id": "67398310000000001a01d85a", "title": "百元内油痘肌秋冬好物（学生党友好）", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67398310000000001a01d85a", "topic_family": "空瓶与产品复盘", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1192, "evidence_unit_count": 35, "original_evidence_unit_count": 35, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 101, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["甚至有一些你塗到它之後 就可以直接讓那個痘痘平掉 我用了它用了兩年", "它對於紅痘痘 就是像我超好 它可以催俗加快我們痘痘的代謝中期", "然後要提醒一下 就是這兩個是不能長期用的 最好就是不要臉用超過五天", "最后是我超爱的传播美容液 我用过各种什么拉门啊 CPB啊,祖马龙等等", "然后秋冬天的话 大家真的可以试试", "你們就不要進在家裡面看了 一定要先去看百大罐好不好 然後是這隻像貴婦乳燕陽防曬", "哪怕也會是漲價了 我也非常願意回購 先說這兩支戰鬥神器 它們兩支加起來不超過40塊錢"], "retained_quotes": ["你們就不要進在家裡面看了 一定要先去看百大罐好不好 然後是這隻像貴婦乳燕陽防曬", "哪怕也會是漲價了 我也非常願意回購 先說這兩支戰鬥神器 它們兩支加起來不超過40塊錢"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67398310000000001a01d85a/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67398310000000001a01d85a/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67398310000000001a01d85a/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67398310000000001a01d85a/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "dd777081a1f1e7340e7bf77e63ae9ee4c03ffe6b9487fbac5c2eb6d682f4b91e", "card_hash": "cdd62811b16be5dfb86112eddfa5e257d2655925f7a67341e6d15c437a3eedfd", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_18", "source_id": "6735c4bf0000000019015d22", "title": "油敏12年快速回到好皮肤的方法", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6735c4bf0000000019015d22", "topic_family": "敏感维稳与红黑脸", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 802, "evidence_unit_count": 25, "original_evidence_unit_count": 25, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 94, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["曾经我因为皮肤明明的问题 花了一千块钱的挂 对 看了一个非常有名的皮肤白大挂", "确实很快 然后市面上所有的修护面霜里 我就是超爱 on top", "用到现在 我已经空瓶了 n瓶了 我的脸上没有因为它 而长过一颗痘痘", "你也都用不了 所以补充纸质去把屏障养好 才是明明皮肤肤的刚需", "用它来补负 一段时间之后 我觉得你也可以拜托 从恢复成这种弹弹的水煮蛋", "不要涂防晒 因为我挂了就要卸 它就是不利于屏障的恢复 而且非常敏的时候", "他告诉我 就是我想要皮肤彻底的快速恢复 就坚持一段时间 不要化妆"], "retained_quotes": ["不要涂防晒 因为我挂了就要卸 它就是不利于屏障的恢复 而且非常敏的时候", "他告诉我 就是我想要皮肤彻底的快速恢复 就坚持一段时间 不要化妆"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6735c4bf0000000019015d22/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6735c4bf0000000019015d22/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6735c4bf0000000019015d22/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6735c4bf0000000019015d22/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "6189b08231743062a3ae7fc037549ba7bd3292d49d7a7eeab7301e58d34da3ff", "card_hash": "b07a8a3c378ffcfcb7e50193fac68d9e144204f9dbbe0d3e771d7859012a5e67", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_18", "source_id": "672d7ed8000000001b010e2b", "title": "30岁油皮快速回春护肤！（秋冬跟练版）", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_672d7ed8000000001b010e2b", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1522, "evidence_unit_count": 46, "original_evidence_unit_count": 46, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 149, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["如果明天我要结婚了 前一天晚上我一定会在家做这个酸油换浮流程", "就做完之后那种不舒服的感觉 另一把就会消失 而且我们前面已经把皮肤通道打开了嘛", "然后记住 就是在法令文最低点的地方 手腕要转一下 让整个手指的中断跟我们皮肤", "减少小气温 还可以把脸的走似往上提拉 让它变得更紧实一些", "然后光滑特别柔软 而且看起来是那种很通透薄满的 那今天就先到这里啰 大家晚安", "特别适合皮肤明明 但是又有配老需求的简单 因为我们要配合按摩手法", "最后一步 我先用一只手按住耳前肌 然后微微往上提拉 用另一只手的这个食指和中指"], "retained_quotes": ["特别适合皮肤明明 但是又有配老需求的简单 因为我们要配合按摩手法", "最后一步 我先用一只手按住耳前肌 然后微微往上提拉 用另一只手的这个食指和中指"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_672d7ed8000000001b010e2b/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_672d7ed8000000001b010e2b/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_672d7ed8000000001b010e2b/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_672d7ed8000000001b010e2b/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "2bb151218db8efe1b8a8f6c6cabe7663415f240f675eb2b09abedea089644838", "card_hash": "eae42ef73d1269fc6c8667357012a96913163e7f8619c5011619f4e3afc166c1", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_18", "source_id": "6724abd30000000019016191", "title": "油痘肌变水光肌~突袭变美晚间护肤！", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6724abd30000000019016191", "topic_family": "提亮与肤色", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1230, "evidence_unit_count": 35, "original_evidence_unit_count": 35, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 113, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["好久沒跟姐妹們分享我的晚間護膚了 剛好明天我有一場直播 趁著這個機會來分享一下", "那如果你們前兩天做了海味秀呢 這一步其實是可以省略的 但是我一般做這種密集變美的護理", "那你當然可以全臉都敷 說到這裡呢 我就是要提醒一下油皮姐妹們", "按壓一下加速它的吸收 有的姐妹說剛上臉會感覺很潤 但其實你給它幾分鐘的時間", "像自己的第二層皮膚 非常非常漂亮的一個妝感 大家趕快去試一試吧", "但是如果是跟我一樣 零食報復我腳的話 想要第二天皮膚融光換發的話", "但是用來用去 還是它最深得我先在用我的水光精華之前呢 先用一個黑豆導成液來打開皮膚通道"], "retained_quotes": ["但是如果是跟我一樣 零食報復我腳的話 想要第二天皮膚融光換發的話", "但是用來用去 還是它最深得我先在用我的水光精華之前呢 先用一個黑豆導成液來打開皮膚通道"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6724abd30000000019016191/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6724abd30000000019016191/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6724abd30000000019016191/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6724abd30000000019016191/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "afbb429fdaf4e36496712fa0c2940f9d099e0dc848215b110d7423835ca02563", "card_hash": "65aaf81897dfe600781a652d2e47ea815b9c3aa60fb4a21357d700367868c12d", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_18", "source_id": "671f88980000000024014b49", "title": "油皮护肤的尽头原来是用酸", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_671f88980000000024014b49", "topic_family": "刷酸与焕肤", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 944, "evidence_unit_count": 24, "original_evidence_unit_count": 24, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["长了十多年痘，我一直很羡慕那些皮肤细腻光滑的水光肌", "分享一款我秋冬季节很喜欢的酸——ALRA嫩豆腐精华，我用下来感觉它不仅可以细腻皮肤、提升肤质，还能增加皮肤的保水力和透明感", "正常情况下我会在洗完脸后直接涂一整滴管，然后叠涂个修护面霜结束", "所以油痘肌的姐妹只要把酸贯彻到日常护肤里面，成为水光肌那是分分钟的事~", "质地像水一样 流动性超好 吸收后肤感很清爽", "如果有姐妹会间断性皮肤敏敏的话，可以避开角质层比较薄的区域单独用在T区，最后再用修护面霜封层就可以了", "它的质地也还挺打动我的，上脸后不会跟胶水一样很黏腻，反而很清爽，我喜欢打圈按摩促进吸收，吸收后皮肤会有一定的润感"], "retained_quotes": ["如果有姐妹会间断性皮肤敏敏的话，可以避开角质层比较薄的区域单独用在T区，最后再用修护面霜封层就可以了", "它的质地也还挺打动我的，上脸后不会跟胶水一样很黏腻，反而很清爽，我喜欢打圈按摩促进吸收，吸收后皮肤会有一定的润感"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_671f88980000000024014b49/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_671f88980000000024014b49/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_671f88980000000024014b49/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_671f88980000000024014b49/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "b299feed736738161e2ab3a6dca2a1e066a2660f31f43a8a2a91af29102a8d33", "card_hash": "da8c645936ba5a6a1c0bfca2ed4de2f10518f2693a48dc38c39796c301768303", "callable": false